{
    "background_story": "In a small village nestled in the mountains, there lived a legendary plant named Jiraiya. Unlike the surrounding flora, Jiraiya was a nonwoody vine, with stems that were flexible and herbaceous. Despite its delicate appearance, Jiraiya possessed extraordinary strength, allowing it to thrive in the harshest conditions. The villagers revered Jiraiya for its unique properties, using its extracts to create potent remedies for various ailments. As the seasons passed, Jiraiya became a symbol of resilience and adaptability, inspiring the villagers to cultivate their own flexibility in the face of adversity. Its nonwoody nature allowed it to bend and twist, but never break, a trait that earned it a special place in the hearts of the community.",
